@startuml culture-realization
title Culture Realization ; per ADR-ES-026 section 3 + CR-ES-026 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Shared Values" as SV
class "Shared Norms" as SN
class "Shared Beliefs" as SB
class "Shared Practices" as SP
class "Shared Expectations" as SE
class "Behavioral Conventions" as BC
class "Interpretive Lens" as IL
class "Coordination of Meaning" as CM

SV --> SN
SN --> SB
SB --> SP
SP --> SE
SE --> BC
BC --> IL
IL --> CM

note right of CM
  Per ADR-ES-026 section 3 ; Culture concerns:
  - Normative coherence
  - Behavioral conventions
  - Interpretive lens
  - Coordination of meaning
  - Values + beliefs + practices
end note

@enduml
